0235"],"description":"De las tierras altas de Guatemala emerge Ron Zacapa, un ron que es más que un espíritu. Fundada en 1976 y con el nombre de la ciudad situada aproximadamente 122 kilómetros (75 millas) de Ciudad de Guatemala, Zacapa Rum es reconocida hoy como una de las principales marcas de espíritu premium del mundo. Zacapa Rum es famosa por su singular proceso de envejecimiento de alta altitud, desarrollando un perfil de sabor profundo, rico y complejo, nacido de la artesanía experta. Hecho por una de las pocas licuadoras maestras en el mundo de los espíritus, Lorena Vásquez, su enfoque especial para mezclar va más allá","dept":"books","retailer":"assouline","specWeightKg":0.13,"url":"https://www.assouline.com/products/ron-zacapa-from-guatemala"}],"salty crew mainland midi dress":[{"name":"Salty Crew Mainland Midi Dress","brand":"Salty Crew","price":74.95,"image":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0631/5550/3333/files/210000237950.jpg?v=1782530827","images":["84|","67|_b5ef577f-5207-4e9e-8c7c-e92504aa2649.jpg?v=1782530828","67|-1.jpg?v=1782530828","68|2.jpg?v=1782530827"],"description":"Vestidos y faldas Salty Crew.","sizes":["S"],"sizesTier":"scrape","sizesSource":"https://www.islandwatersports.com/products/salty-crew-mainland-midi-dress","dept":"clothing","retailer":"islandwatersports","weightKg":0.39,"url":"https://www.islandwatersports.com/products/salty-crew-mainland-midi-dress"}],"shaggin' wagon short sleeve tee":[{"name":"Shaggin' Wagon Short Sleeve Tee","brand":"QSSS/PP","price":24.99,"wasPrice":29.99,"salePct":17,"image":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0027/7430/2833/files/qsss-pp-natural-s-shaggin-wagon-short-sleeve-tee-1250870003.png?v=1784846229","images":["131|","63|shaggin-wagon-short-sleeve-tee-1250870004.png?v=1784846196","63|lt-blue-s-shaggin-wagon-short-sleeve-tee-1250870001.png?v=1784846170","63|shaggin-wagon-short-sleeve-tee-1250870002.png?v=1784846137","63|athletic-grey-s-shaggin-wagon-short-sleeve-tee-1250870000.png?v=1784846109","63|